1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,509
Your life is not over.

2
00:00:02,609 --> 00:00:07,778
If you are still breathing, your story is not finished.

3
00:00:07,878 --> 00:00:13,144
Some people think one painful season means life is over.

4
00:00:13,243 --> 00:00:21,189
But many people's chapters begin after heartbreak, failure, disappointment, or loss.

5
00:00:21,289 --> 00:00:24,734
Sometimes God rebuilds people slowly.

6
00:00:24,833 --> 00:00:27,992
Sometimes healing happens quietly.

7
00:00:28,092 --> 00:00:34,793
But never believe that your life ended because things became difficult.

8
00:00:34,893 --> 00:00:38,530
Your future can still become beautiful.

9
00:00:38,631 --> 00:00:40,832
Thank you for listening.

10
00:00:40,932 --> 00:00:42,000
This is The Open Door with Eden.
